   input:'An explicitly mathematical table gives output 2 U at input 0 V, 6 U at 2 V and 14 U at 4 V. The instructor teaches first-interval change 4 U over 2 V=2 U/V and second 8 U over 2 V=4 U/V. All endpoint subtraction/division steps and independent exact results are supplied. This is average change across each interval, not an instantaneous derivative, uncertainty estimate or physical causal law.',
